  "title": "Board experience: Harmonized view for team-managed projects",
  "product": "Jira platform",
  "status": "rollout_complete",
  "description": "Jira now provides a more consistent board experience for team-managed projects. This update aligns the visual layout and functionality of boards in team-managed projects with those in company-managed projects, making it easier for teams to switch between different project types without losing familiarity. This change helps your team stay focused on work by providing a unified way to track and manage work items across Jira. To get started with this change Open your team-managed project in Jira.\n\t",
